<rect class="bg" width="1440" height="900"/><rect x="28" y="28" width="1384" height="92" rx="18" fill="url(#h)"/><text x="58" y="68" class="t">Agent Hub SOW Performance Test — Execution Result</text><text x="58" y="94" class="sub">Observed performance and stability as concurrent workload increased from 1 to 25 users using a 728 KB PDF workload.</text>
<text x="28" y="158" class="st">TEST EXECUTION RESULTS</text><rect class="c" x="28" y="174" width="1384" height="280" rx="13"/><rect x="48" y="194" width="1344" height="42" rx="8" fill="#eef5f9"/><text x="70" y="220" class="th">CONCURRENT USER</text><text x="245" y="220" class="th">NUM OF FILES</text><text x="515" y="220" class="th">PASS</text><text x="610" y="220" class="th">FAILED</text><text x="720" y="220" class="th">PASSING RATE</text><text x="895" y="220" class="th">AVG RESPONSE TIME (SEC)</text><text x="1180" y="220" class="th">P95 (SEC)</text>
<text x="70" y="270" class="tdb">1</text><text x="245" y="270" class="td">1 (PDF 728 KB)</text><text x="515" y="270" class="td">2</text><text x="610" y="270" class="td">0</text><rect class="good" x="710" y="250" width="94" height="28" rx="14"/><text x="757" y="269" text-anchor="middle" class="goodt">100%</text><text x="895" y="270" class="td">260</text><text x="1180" y="270" class="td">—</text><line class="line" x1="48" y1="289" x2="1392" y2="289"/>
<text x="70" y="320" class="tdb">5</text><text x="245" y="320" class="td">1 (PDF 728 KB)</text><text x="515" y="320" class="td">34</text><text x="610" y="320" class="td">0</text><rect class="good" x="710" y="300" width="94" height="28" rx="14"/><text x="757" y="319" text-anchor="middle" class="goodt">100%</text><text x="895" y="320" class="td">246</text><text x="1180" y="320" class="td">360</text><line class="line" x1="48" y1="339" x2="1392" y2="339"/>
<text x="70" y="370" class="tdb">10</text><text x="245" y="370" class="td">1 (PDF 728 KB)</text><text x="515" y="370" class="td">58</text><text x="610" y="370" class="td">3</text><rect class="warn" x="710" y="350" width="94" height="28" rx="14"/><text x="757" y="369" text-anchor="middle" class="warnt">95.08%</text><text x="895" y="370" class="td">298</text><text x="1180" y="370" class="td">552</text><line class="line" x1="48" y1="389" x2="1392" y2="389"/>
<text x="70" y="420" class="tdb">25</text><text x="245" y="420" class="td">1 (PDF 728 KB)</text><text x="515" y="420" class="td">46</text><text x="610" y="420" class="td">172</text><rect class="bad" x="710" y="400" width="94" height="28" rx="14"/><text x="757" y="419" text-anchor="middle" class="badt">21.10%</text><text x="895" y="420" class="td">371</text><text x="1180" y="420" class="td">540</text>
<text x="28" y="498" class="st">RESULT ASSESSMENT</text><rect class="c" x="28" y="514" width="680" height="166" rx="13"/><text x="50" y="548" class="h3">Load Behaviour</text><text x="50" y="576" class="b">• 1 and 5 concurrent users completed with a 100% passing rate.</text><text x="50" y="600" class="b">• At 10 users, passing rate reduced to 95.08% and P95 increased to 552 sec.</text><text x="50" y="624" class="b">• At 25 users, passing rate fell sharply to 21.10%, with 172 failed executions.</text><text x="50" y="648" class="b">• Average response time increased to 371 sec at the highest executed load.</text>
<rect class="c" x="732" y="514" width="680" height="166" rx="13"/><text x="754" y="548" class="h3">Management Assessment</text><text x="754" y="576" class="b">The executed SOW workload remained stable through 5 concurrent users.</text><text x="754" y="600" class="b">Performance degradation became visible at 10 users, while the 25-user test showed</text><text x="754" y="622" class="b">a material loss of successful task completion and indicates a capacity constraint</text><text x="754" y="644" class="b">under the tested configuration. Further analysis and tuning are required before</text><text x="754" y="666" class="b">re-validating higher SOW concurrency.</text>
<text x="28" y="712" class="st">CONFIRMED ROOT CAUSE</text><rect class="c" x="28" y="728" width="1384" height="128" rx="13"/><text x="50" y="762" class="h3">Container Out of Memory (OOM)</text><text x="50" y="788" class="b">The pod was processing overlapping document and multi-modal executions when the OOM occurred:</text><text x="50" y="812" class="b">• The affected extractor query was active  • Multiple other “/execute” requests were handled concurrently  • Attachment-bearing requests were active</text><text x="50" y="836" class="b">• Another multi-modal request involving four attachments was retrying shortly before the OOM.</text><text x="1412" y="875" text-anchor="end" class="s">Agent Hub Performance Testing • SOW Execution Result • Management View</text></svg>